  "goodToKnow": "Die Geisel is a hostage, always feminine, even for a man: Er war eine Geisel. Jemanden als Geisel nehmen means to take someone hostage, and die Geiselnahme is a hostage-taking. The 1972 Munich Olympics hostage crisis, in which Israeli athletes were killed, led to the creation of Germany's elite police unit GSG 9. Don't confuse it with die Geißel (with ß), a scourge or whip: die Geißel der Menschheit. Plural: die Geiseln."
